<title>USA: ReliaStar Financial Corp Q3 net up.</title>
<headline>ReliaStar Financial Corp Q3 net up.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.26		    $1.10</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.19		    $1.03</p>
<p> Net			 47,900		   42,700</p>
<p> Total revs	     544,600		  522,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	37,700		   37,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	40,300		   39,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 results include investment loss of $100,000 vs loss of $200,000.  </p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary	     $ 3.74		    $3.23</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$3.53		    $3.04</p>
<p> Net			143,700		  125,300</p>
<p> Total revs	   1,624,700		1,548,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	37,200		   36,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	39,800		   39,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month results include investment gain of $5.6 million, or $0.15/shr ($0.14 diluted) vs gain of $3.2 million or $0.09/shr ($0.08 diluted).</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
